🇷🇺 Key points from Putin's statements at the meeting with Russian Defense Ministry leadership:

➡️All Russian MoD rear services will be consolidated under единое командование — Valery Solodchuk appointed to head it;

➡️Putin called Solodchuk one of the most talented commanders;

➡️Andrei Ivanaev to take command of the "Center" grouping in the SMO zone;

➡️Bolgarev to take command of the "Vostok" (East) grouping;

➡️Putin noted the "Vostok" grouping is operating energetically, advancing at a pace deserving the highest marks;

➡️Denis Lyamin to head Russia's unmanned systems forces.

